+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled in all builds, development builds included; there is no exemption for dev. This is the project's current recorded decision, and it is reinforced by the recorded rule of HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions, so plain HTTP is not used for any host.
